000900******************************************************
001000*                                                    *
001100*D  S M O D S I T M                   PU2-4          *
001200*                                                    *
001300*D  THIS SUB PROGRAM MODIFIES CODED ITEM INFO.       *
001400*                                                    *
001500******************************************************
001600*   N O T E    T H I S   S U B R O U T I N E   I S   *
001700*         C A L L E D    B Y :                       *
001800*      1. TPOMOD                                     *
001900******************************************************
012200
      *C  09/28/1992     DAVE PLUM      REQUEST #6100
      *C  ADDED LOGIC TO BLOCK THE USER FROM CHANGING THE DEPT ON
      *C  A PO ITEM
      *C        1) FROM A DIRECT CHARGE DEPT TO THE STOREROOM DEPT
      *C   AND  2) FROM THE STOREROOM DEPT TO A DIRECT CHARGE DEPT
      *C  IF ANY MATERIAL HAS ALREADY BEEN RECEIVED.
      *C
      *C  04/16/93       CATHY KALMAN
      *C  FIXED LOCKING PROBLEM OF DPODATAITM ON SCREEN PU2-4.
      *C  WAS NOT IN HP VERSION.
      *C
      *C   SEPT. 94      JE COFFMAN  REQ #6527
      *C   ADDED CALL TO SCHATREF IF THE USER OPTION SWITCH IS
      *C   SET REQUIRING THAT CHAT NUMBERS BE INCLUDED ON CSIS
      *C   DOCUMENTS CONTAINING CORPORATE CODED ITEMS.
      *C
      *C   02/10/95      J S BUNGO
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO DEAL WITH THE PO-KELLY-QTY WHENEVER
      *C   THE QUANTITY ORDERED IS CHANGED AT A KELLY PLANT.
      *C
      *C   03/03/1995    C A ZUBEK   REQ # 95-009
      *C   ADDED CALL TO "SPOTRACK" TO WRITE TO THE AUDIT TRAIL
      *C   FILE WHEN QUANTITY ORDERED OR UNIT PRICE IS CHANGED.
      *C
      *C   07/10/1995    C A YODER
      *C   ADDED PO ITEM NUMBER TO FIELDS PASSED TO "SPOTRACK."
      *C
      *C   07/18/1996    C A YODER
      *C   RE-COMPILED PROGRAM TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C   10/31/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   ALLOW RECEIVING INSTRUCTIONS.
      *C
      *C   11/20/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   IF QS9000-TRACKING ITEM, DISPLAY TRACKING SCREEN.
      *C
      *C   04/11/97  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC FROM "SADDPITM" TO CHECK IF THE INCREASE IN
      *C   PRICE IS GREATER THAN THE PERCENT ALLOWED IN MPLTINFO.
      *C   THIS IS A VERBAL REQUEST FROM DANVILLE.
      *C
      *C   05/15/97  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO ACCOUNT FOR FRANCHISE VENDORS/ITEMS.
      *C     1.  ITEMS ON FRANCHISED & CONSIGNED POS MUST ALL BE
      *C         STOREROOM ITEMS.
      *C     2.  IF THE PO IS NON-PAYABLE, IT CANNOT BE INVOICELESS.
      *C
      *C   04/02/98  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO ALLOW CONSIGNED ITEMS ON A "000" PO TO BE
      *C   FOR A NON-STOREROOM DEPARTMENT.  OTHERWISE, CONSIGNED
      *C   STOREROOM ITEMS MUST BE ON A REQUIREMENT ORDER.
      *C
      *C   04/08/98  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO ALLOW A CONSIGNED ITEM ON A Z-BILL PO TO
      *C   BE FOR THE STOREROOM DEPARTMENT.
      *C
      *C   04/14/98  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO ALLOW A CONSIGNED ITEM ON A REGULAR PO TO
      *C   BE FOR THE STOREROOM DEPARTMENT.
      *C
      *C   05/21/98  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED CALL TO "SCALCBGT" TO CALCULATE THE CORRECT
      *C   BUDGET AMOUNT FOR THE PO.  DECATUR FOUND THAT THE
      *C   TAX WAS NOT BEING INCLUDED IN THE CALCULATION.
      *C
      *C   06/07/99   CA YODER   (DECATUR REQUEST)
      *C   RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP MTAX DATABASE CHANGE TO
      *C   EXPAND TAX RATE PERCENTAGE FROM 2 DECIMAL PLACES TO 4.
      *C
      *C   09/08/99  CA YODER    NAPANEE REQUEST
      *C   MOVE UNIT VALUE TO MSTORERM MARKET COST FOR REPAIR
      *C   PURCHASE ORDER ITEMS.
      *C
      *C   03/01/00  CA YODER    NAPANEE REQUEST  (D. STUBBS)
      *C   REMOVED LOGIC TO UPDATE MARKET COST FOR REPAIR ORDERS.
      *C
      *C   11/01/00  CA YODER    LAWTON REQUEST
      *C   MODIFIED LOGIC FOR PRICE & QTY CHANGE FOR INVOICELESS
      *C   ORDERS.  ALLOW FOR BOTH PRICE & QTY TO BE ZERO IN ORDER
      *C   TO ALLOW FOR REPAIR ORDER ITEMS.
      *C
      *C   06/12/02  CA YODER    LAWTON REQUEST
      *C     DISPLAY WARNING MESSAGE WHEN PO ITEM AMOUNT EXCEEDS REQ
      *C     BUDGET AMOUNT BY PERCENTAGE SPECIFIED IN MPLTINFO
      *C     (NON-CODED M-REQS ONLY).
      *C
012300
