046700 MODIFY-STOREROOM-ITEM SECTION 10.
       BEGIN-HERE.
           OPEN INPUT MVALIDUM-I, MPLTINFO-PK-I, MVALIDPLTDATA-I,
                      MCOMMENT-I, MSTORERM-I, MTAX-I, DREQD-I,
                      MCLASS-I, DREQITM-I.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE, DPOITEM-O, DPODATAITM-O, DDAILYTC-O.
           MOVE SPACES TO SEDIVNCK-PARMS.
           MOVE BUILD-PO-SEARCH TO SEDIVNCK-PO-NUMBER.
           CALL "SEDIVNCK" USING BASE,
                                 SEDIVNCK-PARMS.

           MOVE "PREQ" TO PLT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-GETKEY-MPLTINFO-PK-I.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
               MOVE "N"                TO  REQ-COMPARE-PERCENT-SW
               MOVE 0                  TO  REQ-COMPARE-PERCENT
           ELSE
           IF MPLTINFO-RQ-COMPARE-PRICE-SW = "Y"
               MOVE MPLTINFO-RQ-COMPARE-PRICE-SW
                                       TO  REQ-COMPARE-PERCENT-SW
               MOVE MPLTINFO-RQ-COMPARE-PERCENT
                                       TO  REQ-COMPARE-PERCENT.

      ********************************************************
      *    RETRIEVE PCPO SWITCH TO DETERMINE IF THE PLANT    *
      *    HAS ELECTED TO UPDATE COMPANY AND PRIME ON THE    *
      *    ITEM SCREEN (SEE PLANT STARTUP-USER OPTIONS).     *
      ********************************************************
           MOVE "PCPO" TO PLT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-GETKEY-MPLTINFO-PK-I.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
               MOVE "N"                TO SAVE-PCPO-SW
           ELSE
           MOVE MPLTINFO-PCPO-SW       TO SAVE-PCPO-SW.

      ********************************************************
      *    RETRIEVE CHAT SWITCH TO DETERMINE IF THE PLANT    *
      *    HAS ELECTED TO MAINTAIN CHAT NUMBERS.             *
      ********************************************************
           MOVE "CHAT" TO PLT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-GETKEY-MPLTINFO-PK-I.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
               MOVE "N"                TO SAVE-CHAT-SW
           ELSE
           MOVE MPLTINFO-CHAT-PURCH-REQUIRED TO SAVE-CHAT-SW.

      *****************************************************
      *
      *   GET FRANCHISE INFORMATION
      *
      *****************************************************

           MOVE "FRAN"                   TO  PLT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-GETKEY-MPLTINFO-PK-I.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
               MOVE SPACES               TO  FRAN-TABLE
           ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-FRANCHISES  TO  FRAN-TABLE.

      *--------- SEE IF PO VENDOR IS A FRANCHISE VENDOR.
           IF FRAN-TABLE > SPACES
               SET FRAN-IDX          TO  1
               SEARCH FRAN-ENTRY
                   AT END
                       MOVE "N"   TO  SAVE-FRANCHISE-SW
                   WHEN FRAN-VEN-CODE(FRAN-IDX) = PO-VEN-CODE
                       MOVE "Y"   TO  SAVE-FRANCHISE-SW.

      ********************************************************
      *    RETRIEVE DSTR KEY TO DETERMINE THE STOREROOM      *
      *    DEPARTMENT.                                       *
      ********************************************************
           MOVE "DSTR" TO PLT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-GETKEY-MPLTINFO-PK-I.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
               MOVE "GETKEY MPLTINFO ERR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE PLT-ARG               TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               GO TO 2100-BLOWUP
           ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-DEPT-STR (1) TO SAVE-STOREROOM-DEPT.

046800
046900     PERFORM 62-MODIFY-ITEM  THRU 62-MI-X.
047000
           CLOSE MVALIDUM-I, MPLTINFO-PK-I, MVALIDPLTDATA-I,
                 MCOMMENT-I, MSTORERM-I, MTAX-I, DREQD-I, MCLASS-I,
                 DISPLAY-FILE, DPOITEM-O, DPODATAITM-O, DDAILYTC-O,
                 DREQITM-I.
047100     GOBACK.
047200
