           MOVE SPACES  TO SWITCH-AREA.
054700     MOVE SPACES                  TO  BUILD-CC-LIT.
054800     IF PO-CURRENCY-CODE = SPACES
054900         NEXT SENTENCE
055000     ELSE
055100**         CURRENCY
055200         MOVE  3                  TO  LANG-SETNUM
055300         MOVE  140                TO  LANG-MSGNUM
055400         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
055500         MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER      TO  CURRENCY-LIT
055600         MOVE PO-CURRENCY-CODE    TO  UM-ARG
               MOVE UM-ARG TO VALIDUM OF MVALIDUM-REC-I
               READ MVALIDUM-I INTO BUF-MVALIDUM
                   INVALID KEY MOVE "2" TO FILE-STATUS-2 END-READ
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
056300             MOVE "GET MVALIDUM *62-MI" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
056400             MOVE UM-ARG      TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
056500             GO TO 2100-BLOWUP
               ELSE
056700             MOVE VALID-CURRENCY-DESC  TO  CUR-CODE-DESC
056800             MOVE PO-CURRENCY-CODE     TO  CUR-CODE.
056900
