059900                                     CONT-SW.
           IF SEDIVNCK-EDI-IND = "Y"
               MOVE "EDI PO"            TO DE2-EDILIT
                                           DE2-EDILIT-L.
           MOVE ZEROS TO DE2-ITEM, DE2-PRICE, DE2-ORD-QTY,
                         DE2-ITEM-VALUE, DE2-ITEM-L, DE2-PRICE-L,
                         DE2-ORD-QTY-L, DE2-ITEM-VALUE-L.
