           IF DE2-ITEM = ZEROS
      *         YOU MUST ENTER AN ITEM NUMBER
               MOVE 66110 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
069800         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE2-MESSAGE-LINE
                                      DE2-MESSAGE-LINE-L
069900         MOVE 3  TO FIELD-NUMBER
070000         PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
070100         GO TO 62-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-2.
