      **********************************************************
      *  IF THE DEPT HAS CHANGED AND DLVR QTY IS NOT ZERO,     *
      *  DISALLOW:                                             *
      *  1) CHANGE FROM A DIRECT CHARGE DEPT TO STOREROOM DEPT *
      *    AND                                                 *
      *  2) CHANGE FROM STOREROOM DEPT TO A DIRECT CHARGE DEPT *
      *  REQUEST #6100 - SEPTEMBER 1992                        *
      **********************************************************
           IF (DE2-SUBDTL = ITM-SUB-DETL) OR (ITM-QTY-DLVR = ZERO)
             NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
             IF ITM-SUB-DETL = SAVE-STOREROOM-DEPT
      *M       C203: CANNOT CHANGE STOREROOM DEPT TO DIRECT CHARGE
      *M        DEPT, DLVR > 0
               MOVE   3  TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE 203  TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE2-MESSAGE-LINE
                                      DE2-MESSAGE-LINE-L
               MOVE 12   TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU 4-PGM-ERROR-X
               GO TO 62-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-2B
             ELSE
               IF DE2-SUBDTL = SAVE-STOREROOM-DEPT
      *M         C202: CANNOT CHANGE DIRECT CHARGE DEPT TO STOREROOM
      *M          DEPT, DLVR > 0
                 MOVE   3  TO LANG-SETNUM
                 MOVE 202  TO LANG-MSGNUM
                 PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                 MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE2-MESSAGE-LINE
                                        DE2-MESSAGE-LINE-L
                 MOVE 12   TO FIELD-NUMBER
                 PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU 4-PGM-ERROR-X
                 GO TO 62-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-2B.

