146900**   CODED ITEM EDITS.  IF MASTER STOCK CODE MAKE
147000**   SURE CODE EXISTS.  CHECK TO MAKE SURE UNIT OF
147100**   MEASURES ARE VALID.
147200*******************************************************
147300
147400 621-EDIT-CODED-ITEM.
147500     MOVE SPACES                  TO ERR-SW.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-I.
           READ MSTORERM-I INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
147600*A   CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-MSTORERM, MODE7,
147700*A          STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MSTORERM, CODE-ARG.
147800     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
147900         IF COND-WORD = 17
148000             IF MASTER-STOCK-EDIT-SW = "Y"
148100*                "STORES CODE DOES NOT EXIST"
