                       MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE2-MESSAGE-LINE
                                              DE2-MESSAGE-LINE-L
148500                 MOVE 37  TO FIELD-NUMBER
148600                 PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
148700                 MOVE "Y"  TO  ERR-SW
148800                 GO TO 621-ECI-X
148900             ELSE
