149800         MOVE   4 TO LANG-MSGNUM
149900         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE2-MESSAGE-LINE
                                      DE2-MESSAGE-LINE-L
