150100         PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
150200         MOVE "Y" TO  ERR-SW
150300         GO TO 621-ECI-X.
150400
150500     IF DE2-PRICE-UM = STR-UM OR STR-UM1 OR STR-UM2
