                   MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE2-MESSAGE-LINE
                                          DE2-MESSAGE-LINE-L
153900             ADD 21, SUB  GIVING FIELD-NUMBER
154000             PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
154100             MOVE "Y"  TO  ERR-SW
154200         ELSE
154300             MOVE "GET MCOMMENT * 621-EC" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
