155100*                                           *
155200*  THIS ROUTINES FIND THE FIRST SELECTED    *
155300*  MANUFACTURER FOR THE PRIMARY LANGUAGE    *
155400*  BY CALLING 'CDESC'                       *
155500*                                           *
155600*********************************************
155700
155800 621-GET-ONE-MANUFACTURER.
155900     MOVE "M"                     TO  CDESC-DESC-OPTION.
