164700     ELSE
           IF SAVE-PCPO-SW = "Y"
               MOVE "POMOD4BL"           TO  VIEW-NFNAME
           ELSE
           IF SAVE-CHAT-SW = "Y"
164800         MOVE "POMOD4B"            TO  VIEW-NFNAME
           ELSE
           MOVE "POMOD4BNC"              TO  VIEW-NFNAME.
