165700 621-CALC-ADDR.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PO-ARG TO PORCVNO OF DPODATAITM-REC-O.
           MOVE SAVE-ITEM-SEQ-NO TO ITEMSEQNO OF DPODATAITM-REC-O.
           READ DPODATAITM-O INTO BUF-DPODATAITM
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
165800*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-DPODATAITM, MODE4,
165900*        STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-DPODATAITM, CALC-ADDR.
166000     IF COND-WORD NOT = ZEROS
